 - Ticket assignment: `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee` assigns an open or in-progress ticket to an agent, or unassigns it.
 - Every ticket includes `assignee` (`null` when unassigned). `GET /tickets` filters by `assignee`; empty `assignee=` is the unassigned tickets.
 - The assigned agent is notified. The command-line listing shows each ticket's assignee.
+- `POST /tickets/import` bulk-creates tickets from the old tracker: all of a batch, or none, at most 5000.
 
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
